    }

    /**
     * Returns a read-only map of nested elements supported
     * by the introspected class.
     *
     * @return a nested-element name to nested-element <code>Class</code>
     *         unmodifiable map. Can be empty, but never <code>null</code>.
     * @since Ant 1.6.3
